@startuml
title FE-12 Edit or Archive Member Design
actor Member
participant WorkshopRingDesignController
participant WorkshopRingDesignApplicationService
database RingDesignRepository
Member -> WorkshopRingDesignController : edit or archive owned design
WorkshopRingDesignController -> WorkshopRingDesignApplicationService : command + If-Match-Version
WorkshopRingDesignApplicationService -> RingDesignRepository : check owner, state and version
alt edit valid saved version
  WorkshopRingDesignApplicationService -> RingDesignRepository : create next immutable version
else archive
  WorkshopRingDesignApplicationService -> RingDesignRepository : set ARCHIVED soft state
else stale or foreign
  WorkshopRingDesignApplicationService --> WorkshopRingDesignController : 403/409 safe error
end
WorkshopRingDesignController --> Member : updated history projection
note over Member
No hard delete and no booking lock in current flow.
end note
@enduml
